  "description": "“Why, why are you crying, Alice?” \n\nOn their wedding night, Daniel faced an unexpected situation. Alice, who had been sobbing for a while, clutched her teddy bear and whispered in a trembling voice. \n\n“...Can we not do it? That thing?”    \n“Pardon?”     \n“I don’t want to do that. Can’t we just not do it?” \n\nAlice had always been told by her parents to keep her distance from such acts as a noble duchess, but the moment she got married, they began clamoring for her to adapt to it faster than anyone else. Confused, Alice slowly begins to discover new desires sleeping within her. In the midst of this, she happens to witness her husband, Daniel, out on a date with another woman...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002473)",
